#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:89
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WantToTradeDecor"
msgid ""
"Hi, I'm the TRADER.\n"
"Want to trade decorations with me?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是交换商。\n"
"要和我交换装饰品吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:93
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TraderFeelingTheBlues"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've left me feeling the blues…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我好失落……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:97
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WeveAlreadyTraded"
msgid ""
"But we've traded decorations already,\n"
"you and I.$"
msgstr ""
"可是我们已经\n"
"交换过装饰品了。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:101
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PickADecorItem"
msgid ""
"If you see any decorative item that\n"
"you want of mine, speak up.$"
msgstr ""
"如果有你想要的装饰品，\n"
"就告诉我吧。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:105
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YouDontWantAnything"
msgid ""
"You don't want anything?\n"
"I feel unwanted…$"
msgstr ""
"你什么都不想要吗？\n"
"我感觉被嫌弃了……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:109
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_OnceBelongedToPlayerDoYouWantIt"
msgid ""
"That decorative item once belonged\n"
"to {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Do you want it?$"
msgstr ""
"那件装饰品\n"
"曾经属于{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你想要吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:114
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YouDontHaveAnyDecor"
msgid ""
"Uh… Wait a second. You don't have a\n"
"single piece of decoration!$"
msgstr ""
"呃……等一下。你连\n"
"一件装饰品都没有啊！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:118
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PickTheDecorToTrade"
msgid ""
"Okay, pick the decoration that you'll\n"
"trade to me.$"
msgstr ""
"好，选一件\n"
"要和我交换的装饰品吧。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:122
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YouDontWantToTrade"
msgid ""
"You won't trade with me?\n"
"I feel unwanted…$"
msgstr ""
"你不和我交换吗？\n"
"我感觉被嫌弃了……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:126
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YouveNoRoomForThis"
msgid ""
"You've got all the {STR_VAR_2}S that can\n"
"be stored. You've no room for this.$"
msgstr ""
"你的{STR_VAR_2}已经存满了。\n"
"没有地方放这个了。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:130
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SoWellTradeTheseDecor"
msgid ""
"Okay, so we'll trade my {STR_VAR_3}\n"
"for your {STR_VAR_2}?$"
msgstr ""
"好，那就用我的{STR_VAR_3}\n"
"交换你的{STR_VAR_2}，对吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:134
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ThatDecorIsInUse"
msgid ""
"That piece of decoration is in use.\n"
"You can't trade it.$"
msgstr ""
"那件装饰品正在使用中。\n"
"不能交换。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:138
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SendDecorToYourPC"
msgid ""
"Then we'll trade!\n"
"I'll send my decoration to your PC.$"
msgstr ""
"那就交换吧！\n"
"我会把装饰品送到你的电脑里。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:142
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CantTradeThatOne"
msgid ""
"Oops! Sorry! That's a really rare\n"
"piece of decoration.\l"
"I can't trade that one away!\p"
"Can I interest you in something else?$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀！抱歉！那是一件\n"
"非常稀有的装饰品。\l"
"那个我可不能换给你！\p"
"要不要看看别的？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:233
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WillYouHearMyTale"
msgid ""
"I'm the STORYTELLER.\n"
"I'll tell you tales of legendary\l"
"TRAINERS.\p"
"Will you hear my tale?$"
msgstr ""
"我是说书人。\n"
"我会讲述传说中的\l"
"训练家们的故事。\p"
"要听我讲故事吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:239
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_StorytellerFeelingTheBlues"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've left me feeling the blues…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我好失落……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:243
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WhichTaleToTell"
msgid ""
"I know of these legends.\n"
"Which tale will you have me tell?$"
msgstr ""
"我知道这些传说。\n"
"你想听哪个故事呢？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:247
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IKnowNoTales"
msgid ""
"But, I know of no legendary TRAINERS.\n"
"Hence, I know no tales.\p"
"Where does one find a TRAINER worthy\n"
"of a legendary tale?$"
msgstr ""
"可是，我不知道\n"
"任何传说中的训练家。\l"
"所以，我没有故事可讲。\p"
"到哪里才能找到\n"
"值得成为传说的训练家呢？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:253
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_YouDidStatXTimes"
msgid ""
"What's that?!\n"
"You… You…\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} time(s)?!\p"
"That is indeed magnificent!\n"
"It's the birth of a new legend!$"
msgstr ""
"什么？！\n"
"你……你……\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"居然有{STR_VAR_1}次？！\p"
"真是太了不起了！\n"
"新的传说诞生了！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:261
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CouldThereBeOtherLegends"
msgid ""
"It gets me thinking, could there be\n"
"other TRAINERS with more impressive\l"
"legends awaiting discovery?$"
msgstr ""
"这让我不禁思考，会不会还有\n"
"其他拥有更惊人传说的\l"
"训练家等待着被发现呢？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:266
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HaveYouAnyLegendaryTales"
msgid ""
"Are you a TRAINER?\p"
"Then tell me, have you any tales that\n"
"are even remotely legendary?$"
msgstr ""
"你是训练家吗？\p"
"那告诉我，你有没有\n"
"哪怕一点点称得上传说的故事？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:272
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HearAnotherLegendaryTale"
msgid ""
"Incidentally… Would you care to hear\n"
"another legendary tale?$"
msgstr ""
"对了……\n"
"你想再听一个传说故事吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:276
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NotWorthyOfLegend"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"I'm not satisfied…\p"
"I wish you would bring me news worthy\n"
"of being called a legend.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"我不满意……\p"
"希望你能带给我\n"
"称得上是传说的消息。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:282
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IWishMorePeopleWereInterested"
msgid ""
"I wish more people would be interested\n"
"in hearing my epic tales of legendary\l"
"TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"真希望有更多的人愿意听我讲\n"
"传说中的训练家们的\l"
"壮丽故事啊。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:287
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SavedGameTitle"
msgid "The Save-Happy TRAINER$"
msgstr "爱记录的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:290
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SavedGameAction"
msgid "Saved the game$"
msgstr "记录了游戏$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:293
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SavedGameStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER saved the game\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} times!\p"
"A more cautious TRAINER than\n"
"{STR_VAR_3} one will never find!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一位名叫{STR_VAR_3}的\n"
"训练家的故事。\p"
"这位训练家记录了游戏\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}次！\p"
"再也找不到比{STR_VAR_3}\n"
"更谨慎的训练家了！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:301
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrendsStartedTitle"
msgid "The Trendsetter TRAINER$"
msgstr "引领潮流的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:304
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrendsStartedAction"
msgid "Started trends$"
msgstr "引领了潮流$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:307
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrendsStartedStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER started new trends\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} times!\p"
