msgstr "在家里让宝可梦休息了$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:446
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RestedAtHomeStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER healed POKéMON\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} times at home!\p"
"There could be no more of a homebody\n"
"than {STR_VAR_3}!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一位名叫{STR_VAR_3}的\n"
"训练家的故事。\p"
"这位训练家在家里\n"
"为宝可梦恢复了{STR_VAR_1}次！\p"
"再也没有人比{STR_VAR_3}\n"
"更恋家了！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:454
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SafariGamesTitle"
msgid "The SAFARI-Loving TRAINER$"
msgstr "爱狩猎的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:457
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_SafariGamesAction"
