msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsedDaycareTitle"
msgid "The DAY CARE-Using Trainer$"
msgstr "爱用培育屋的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:750
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsedDaycareAction"
msgid "Left POKéMON at the DAY CARE$"
msgstr "把宝可梦寄放在培育屋$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:753
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_UsedDaycareStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER left POKéMON with the\n"
"DAY CARE {STR_VAR_1} times!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} must be a real go-getter\n"
"who raises POKéMON aggressively!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一位名叫{STR_VAR_3}的\n"
"训练家的故事。\p"
"这位训练家把宝可梦\n"
"寄放在培育屋{STR_VAR_1}次！\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}一定是一位积极\n"
"培育宝可梦的实干家！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:761
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RodeCableCarTitle"
msgid "The CABLE CAR-Loving TRAINER$"
msgstr "爱坐缆车的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:764
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RodeCableCarAction"
msgid "Rode the CABLE CAR$"
msgstr "乘坐了缆车$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:767
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RodeCableCarStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER rode the CABLE CAR\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} times!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} must be a busy TRAINER\n"
"who's up and down all the time!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一位名叫{STR_VAR_3}的\n"
"训练家的故事。\p"
"这位训练家乘坐了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}次缆车！\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}一定是一位整天\n"
"上上下下的忙碌训练家！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:775
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HotSpringsTitle"
msgid "The Hot Spring-Loving TRAINER$"
msgstr "爱泡温泉的训练家$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:778
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HotSpringsAction"
msgid "Bathed in hot springs$"
msgstr "泡了温泉$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:781
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HotSpringsStory"
msgid ""
"This is a tale of a TRAINER\n"
"named {STR_VAR_3}.\p"
"This TRAINER bathed in hot springs\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} times!\p"
"{STR_VAR_3} must be a TRAINER with\n"
"baby-smooth skin!$"
msgstr ""
"这是一位名叫{STR_VAR_3}的\n"
"训练家的故事。\p"
"这位训练家泡了\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}次温泉！\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}一定是一位\n"
"皮肤像婴儿一样光滑的训练家！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:855
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HearMyStory"
msgid ""
"I'm GIDDY!\n"
"I have a scintillating story for you!\p"
"Would you like to hear my story?$"
msgstr ""
"我是飘飘然！\n"
"我有个精彩的故事要讲给你听！\p"
"想听听我的故事吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:860
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GiddyFeelingTheBlues"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've left me feeling the blues…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我好失落……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:864
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AlsoIWasThinking"
msgid "Also, I was thinking…$"
msgstr "还有，我在想……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:867
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WeShouldChatAgain"
msgid ""
"That's about it, I think…\p"
"We should chat again!\n"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"我想大概就是这些了……\p"
"我们下次再聊吧！\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:918
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WouldYouLikeToHearMySong"
msgid ""
"Hi, I'm the BARD.\n"
"Would you like to hear my song?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是吟游诗人。\n"
"想听听我的歌吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:922
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BardFeelingTheBlues1"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've left me feeling the blues…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我好失落……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:926
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WishICouldPlaySongForOthers"
msgid ""
"Oh, what a moving song…\n"
"I wish I could play it for others…$"
msgstr ""
"哦，多么感人的歌啊……\n"
"真希望能唱给别人听……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:930
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_WouldYouLikeToWriteSomeLyrics"
msgid ""
"So?\n"
"How do you like my song?\p"
"But I'm none too happy about\n"
"the lyrics.\p"
"How would you like to write some\n"
"new lyrics for me?$"
msgstr ""
"怎么样？\n"
"你觉得我的歌如何？\p"
"不过，我对歌词\n"
"不太满意。\p"
"你愿意帮我\n"
"写一些新歌词吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:938
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_BardFeelingTheBlues2"
msgid ""
"Oh…\n"
"You've left me feeling the blues…$"
msgstr ""
"哦……\n"
"你让我好失落……$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:942
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LetMeSingItForYou"
msgid ""
"Thank you kindly!\n"
"Let me sing it for you.$"
msgstr ""
"太感谢你了！\n"
"让我唱给你听吧。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:946
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ThatHowYouWantedSongToGo"
msgid ""
"Was that how you wanted your song\n"
"to go?$"
msgstr ""
"这就是你想要的\n"
"歌曲吗？$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:950
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IllSingThisSongForAWhile"
msgid ""
"Okay! That's it, then.\n"
"I'll sing this song for a while.$"
msgstr ""
"好！那就这样吧。\n"
"我会唱这首歌一段时间。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:954
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TeachWhatsHipAndHappening"
msgid ""
"Hey, yo! They call me the HIPSTER.\n"
"I'll teach you what's hip and happening.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，哟！大家都叫我潮人。\n"
"我来教你什么是最潮的流行语。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:958
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IAlreadyTaughtYou"
msgid ""
"But, hey, I taught you what's hip and\n"
"happening already.\p"
"I'd like to spread the good word to\n"
"other folks.$"
msgstr ""
"不过，嘿，我已经教过你\n"
"最潮的流行语了。\p"
"我还想把好东西\n"
"传播给其他人。$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:964
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_IveGotNothingNewToTeach"
msgid ""
"But, hey, you already know a lot about\n"
"what's hip and happening.\p"
"I've got nothing new to teach you!$"
msgstr ""
"不过，嘿，你已经很懂\n"
"最潮的流行语了。\p"
"我没有什么新东西可以教你了！$"

#: data/scripts/mauville_man.inc:969
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HaveYouHeardOfWord"
msgid ""
"Hey, have you heard about\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”?\p"
"What's it mean? Well…\n"
"Ask your daddy or mommy, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你听说过\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”吗？\p"
"什么意思？这个嘛……\n"
"去问你爸爸妈妈吧，好吗？$"
